<title>GERMANY: Three killed in Turkish shootout in Berlin.</title>
<headline>Three killed in Turkish shootout in Berlin.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three people were killed and two others injured on Sunday evening in a shootout in a Berlin block of flats between two Turkish families, police said.</p>
<p>Police said the shootout was prompted by an argument between the feuding families, who both lived in the block.</p>
<p>They said a murder investigation had begun, but gave no further details.</p>
